title: CEO1
dir: commune
---
Jeff: Ever since the revolution they've kept me here stacking boxes #line:6590288
Jeff: Those peasants don't know the value of hard work. #line:61085
Jeff: They could never understand the joy of shareholder value, or stock prices rising, or the thrill of pulling of your first successful rug pull. #line:11105309
Jeff: Oh the joys of capitalism. How I miss you. #line:15430720
===

