===

title: Dave
dir: commune
---
<<declare $d_dave_count = 0>>
-> Where am I? <<if not $d_dave1>> #line:1673539
  Dave: I just told you, silly. #line:14310969
  Dave: You're in a big ol' commune of friends. #line:4562558
  Dave: If you have any questions, I'm your duderino. #line:13503291
  <<set $d_intro = true>>
  <<set $d_dave1 = true>>
  <<set $d_dave_count = $d_dave_count + 1>>
  <<jump Dave>>
-> Anarcho, huh? <<if not $d_dave2>> #line:2429883
  Dave: Anarcho Syndicalist! #line:4038891
  Dave: I'm gonna honest, I have no idea what it all means. #line:3771426
  Dave: But it has my name at the end of it so it must be good! #line:1325336
  -> How did that happen? #line:16721185
    Dave: Well you see one night I was sloshed at the pub with my mates. #line:15550566
    Dave: And we got to talking about the miserable state of affairs round these parts. #line:4523041
    Dave: It was even worse than Scunthorpe. #line:15130587
    Dave: To cut a long story short we stumbled out the pub protesting the state of things. #line:16515755
    Dave: When the local council saw us coming they up and ran away. #line:8938234
    Dave: And by the time I woke up with a hangover I was bloody well in charge. #line:3146142
    Dave: Or at least I think that's how things went down. #line:3688498
    <<set $d_intro = true>>
    <<set $d_dave2 = true>>
    <<set $d_dave_count = $d_dave_count + 1>>
    <<jump Dave>>
-> Did I just fall from the sky? <<if $d_intro && not $d_dave3>> #line:14876656
  Dave: Happens all the time. #line:3382850
  Dave: Sometimes. #line:892829
  Dave: You'll get used to it. #line:10258889
  <<set $d_dave3 = true>>
  <<set $d_dave_count = $d_dave_count + 1>>
  <<jump Dave>>
-> I know this is the commune, but where are we *geographically*? <<if $d_dave1 && not $d_dave4>> #line:13485050
  Dave: Half way between Hull and Birmingham. #line:7115870
  Dave: Just north of Norwich. #line:13307725
  Dave: South by south west of Manchester. #line:5343421
  Dave: Roughly 28° south of Coventry. #line:15266290
  Dave: About an hour by bus from Swindon. #line:6566055
  Dave: Twenty minutes east of the midlands. #line:2411056
  Dave: We used to be twinned with Mügeln. #line:9553237
  Dave: Does that clear it up #line:9691338
  -> My head hurts. #line:5263726
    Dave: Well get some ale and chips into you. It'll clear that right up. #line:2295028
  -> You're British?? #line:14273870
    Dave: As British as Chips and Curry. #line:12488020
  -> You're Northern?? #line:15752441
    Dave: Right you are. #line:16664469
  <<set $d_dave4 = true>>
  <<set $d_dave_count = $d_dave_count + 1>>
  <<jump Dave>>
-> Listen, this has been great and all, but I just wanna go home at this point <<if $d_dave_count > 1 && not $d_dave5>> #line:7236381
  Dave: Aww, now why would you say that? #line:7413507
  -> I had the weirdest day, you wouldn't believe it. #line:2561743
    Dave: Listen here, I happen to believe in a lot of stuff. #line:3978506
    -> No, really. This all truly was an extremely incohesive fever dream. #line:12185778
      Dave: Now you sound like one of the Eaters. #line:9889833
      -> This is not sounding any better. #line:2974179
        Dave: Relax, that's just one of the clubs. #line:11380209
  -> I don't think the commune life is for me. #line:10337167
    Dave: Have you even tried? You could join a club! #line:15764061
    -> I'm sure I can find a chess club or whatever at home. #line:12841135
      Dave: Chess, sure. But I bet you haven't seen anything remotely like what we have here.. #line:14388409
  -> I'm a level 5 anarchist. I don't live anywhere where there are buildings. #line:7341841
    Dave: Hey, I know I'm a big oaf, but no need to make fun of me. #line:9319376
    Dave: Lighten a bit up, you're like a Yeeter #line:1440398
    -> That combination of words is meaningless #line:5754392
      Dave: What? Oh! That's the name of the club. #line:8031782

  -> Okay, I'll bite. What the heck does that mean? #line:1279506
    Dave: Hmm, as the leader, I should probably not speak for them. #line:7399095
    -> That's literally what a leader does. #line:14267146
      Dave: Not an anarchist leader! #line:16018729
    -> Okay, who do I talk to then? #line:935685
    Dave: Look, there's a bunch of friendly faces around here. #line:14628177
    Dave: Well, at least a bunch of people with the exact same friendly face. #line:5814791
    <<complete_objective "obj_1">>
    <<set $d_go_talk = true>>
    Dave: Go be a part of the community and talk to them. #line:15510360

===


title: Storm
dir: commune
---
<<if $d_go_talk>>
  Storm: Hey there, new friendo! You should chat up Dave!
<<elseif not $d_storm>>
  Storm: Hello there. #line:491159
  Storm: You wouldn't have happened to see a house fly by you while you were up in the air? #line:12182704
  Storm: There was a right storm last night and it appears to have made off with our house. #line:14277538
  -> No #line:4686347
    Storm: That's a shame. #line:892195
    Storm: Where on earth are we going to sleep? #line:14991202
    -> Maybe you could build a house out of one of those mushrooms? #line:10692078
      Storm: You're a genius, we're saved. #line:15678450
  Storm: Now I can finally focus on getting the sacrifice ready.
  -> The what now?
    Storm: The sacrifice for the mouth!
    -> The WHAT now?
      Storm: Ah, you don't know about the Eaters yet. You should
  <<set $d_storm = true>>
<<endif>>
===

